			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Flatten ScannedExtensions module structure\n\nRemove extensive header documentation and flatten the `ScannedExtensions` module hierarchy in `ApplicationState`. Replace the previous dual-module pattern (`mod.rs` re-exporting `ScannedExtensions.rs`) with a single canonical path where the struct resides in `ScannedExtensions/ScannedExtensions.rs`.\n\nThis aligns with the ongoing decomposition of `ExtensionState` into file-per-struct PascalCase modules, ensuring consistent symbol resolution for the `Registration` DTO used by the gRPC `Vine` protocol handlers.",
