			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Simplify ProviderRegistration module structure\n\nRemove extensive header documentation and flatten the `ProviderRegistration` module hierarchy in `ApplicationState`. Replace the previous dual-module pattern (`mod.rs` re-exporting `ProviderRegistration.rs`) with a single canonical path where the struct resides in `ProviderRegistration/ProviderRegistration.rs`.\n\nThis aligns with the ongoing decomposition of `ExtensionState` into file-per-struct PascalCase modules, ensuring consistent symbol resolution for the `Registration` DTO used by the gRPC `Vine` protocol handlers.",
			"SHA": "dcea36c734da4254b4c6750a1be2dd09fc551e6c"
